# JARVIS Environment Variables Template
# 
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file and rename to .env (in the same directory as main.py)
# 2. Fill in your actual values (keep the .env file SECRET - never commit to git!)
# 3. Python will auto-load these variables when you run Jarvis
#
# SECURITY: Add .env to .gitignore so it's never committed!
#

# Required: OpenAI API key (get from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-actual-key-here

# Optional: If you want to use your own OpenAI base URL or custom endpoint
# OPENAI_API_BASE=https://api.openai.com/v1

# Optional: Proxy settings (if behind corporate firewall)
# HTTPS_PROXY=http://proxy.corp.com:8080
# HTTP_PROXY=http://proxy.corp.com:8080
